      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Since the introduction of Android support released in [VRChat 2023.3.1m](https://docs.vrchat.com/docs/vrchat-202331m) on 17 August 2023 (alpha) / [VRChat 2023.4.2p2m](https://docs.vrchat.com/docs/vrchat-202342p2m) on 8 December 2023 (beta), this performance tip conflicts with the avatar SDK builder's advice to merge skinned mesh renderers. Following this \"Viseme Performance Tip!\" from the VRChat Creation documentation would also make mobile avatars have a minimum of \"Medium\" performance ranking ([Avatar Performance Ranking § Mobile Limits](https://creators.vrchat.com/avatars/avatar-performance-ranking-system/#mobile-limits)) for any avatar with eyelook / visemes shapekeys.",
